  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.5.2\n\n            Highlights:\n            - [SoftDelete] generated DAO restore/hard-delete methods now live directly on DAO implementations.\n            - [SoftDelete] DAO [Query] methods now auto-filter deleted rows at prepare-time.\n            - [Encrypted] properties are now automatically decrypted after generated SELECT queries.\n            - [Auditable] entities now auto-populate CreatedAt/UpdatedAt and support IAuditContext user tracking.\n\n            Generated Code & Performance:\n            - Parallel generated DAOs now use DbSession.GetOrCreateCommand(...) instead of shared DbCommand state.\n            - Serialized generated DAOs now use shared DaoHelpers for transaction normalization, cached commands, and cloned-command disposal.\n            - Reduced generated allocation/disposal overhead across DAO and DatabaseImpl code paths.\n            - Insert generation now avoids unnecessary SQL Server fallback delegate allocations when fallback cannot run.\n\n            Fixes:\n            - Fixed GlobalFilter parameter binding in parallel generated SELECT queries.\n            - Fixed QueryCache.InvalidateByPrefix() to return int as expected by QueryExtensions.\n            - Fixed [Auditable] code generation to call IAuditContext.GetCurrentUser().\n            - Fixed soft-delete generated SQL/parameter caching consistency in parallel mode.\n\n            Docs & Coverage:\n            - Added README coverage for GlobalFilters and other previously undocumented features.\n            - Added generator/runtime tests covering soft-delete caching, serialized helper usage, insert fallback rules, and GlobalFilter parameter binding.",
